    "name": "projreind",
    "author": "MaboroshiX",
    "description": "\nOBJECTIVE: Retrieve the forgotten technology.\n\n\nA mod inspired by Greg's Tech and Factorio that makes manufacturing realistic and even harder.\nRemade and improved version of Reindustrialization.\n\nMod features:\n- Distinct style of gameplay with realistic and hardcore production.\n- Peaceful sectors focused on mass production.\n- A separate and complex tech tree.\n- Tons of multi-crafters and intermediates.\n- Pipe corrosion and more mechanics stolen from Greg's Tech.\n\n\nRequired mods:\n- Lovecraftian Library\n- Lovecraftian Laboratory\n- Fluid Cells\n\n\nOptional mods:\n- TooManyItems\n\n\nWARNING: RECIPE HELL AHEAD!\n\n\nDo not directly download ProjReind and its dependencies in mod browser. The game chooses latest version differently for Java mods and JS/JSON mods, which can lead to unmatched version or even crash.\n\nDownload every single mod from \"View Releases\" manually. Do not rely on any means of auto-download or auto-update.\n\nVersion number including a date number (xxx.x.xxxxxxxx) is for unstable test versions. Normally you shouldn't download them, do not try test versions unless you're ready.\n",
